{"articleNo":"68486","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=68486&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"MSC과목 이수구분 일괄 변경 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.10.23","hit":"7266","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" color=\"#660033\"><strong></strong></font></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #faecc5\" color=\"#660033\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Verdana\">기이수한 MSC과목 이수구분을 아래와 같이 일괄 변경함을 알려드립니다.</span></span></strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><font color=\"#003399\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">* 변경 사항 : MSC선택(기선)→MSC필수(기필)</span></font></span></strong></p></span></span></strong><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 변경 사유</span></span><br></strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">공학교육인증 시행에 따라 MSC선택과목이 필수과목으로 변경되는 과목이 많고, </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; MSC필수과목을 타학부(과)에서 수강한 경우 선택으로&nbsp;표기되어&nbsp;필수로 변경하고자 함</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; 나</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">.&nbsp;</span>이수구분을 일괄 변경 처리함으로 학생들에게 편의 제공</span><br></p><strong></strong><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2. </span></span><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">변경 사항 : MSC선택(기선)→MSC필수(기필)</span></strong></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong></strong></font>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">3. </span>변경 대상 : 재학생, 휴학생[현재 기준]</span><br></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">4. </span>변경 범위 : 2006학년도 이수과목부터 현재까지</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">5. </span>변경 일자 : 2012.11.01.(목)[예정]</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012. 10. 23. </span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 처&nbsp; 장</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
